{"alias":"/schools/nutrition/studenteligibility/mealbenefittoolkit","title":"Meal Benefit Application Toolkit for Schools","changed":"2026-06-17T19:25:07+00:00","before":"<p>The family income data provided by the application informs key&nbsp;<strong>funding&nbsp;</strong>for school resources. This includes school meal reimbursements, funding for Title I programs, funding and resources for after school programs, funding provided to schools from the Maine State Legislature for essential programs and services at school, funding for special education, teacher loan forgiveness, and much,&nbsp;<em>much&nbsp;</em>more!</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The resources below can be used by districts and schools to help inform parents, caregivers, and staff members about the importance of the Meal Benefit Application in hopes of getting as many families and caregivers to fill out and return the application as possible.&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"card-deck\">\r\n<div class=\"card\">\r\n<div class=\"card-body\">\r\n<h5 class=\"card-title\">Social Media Graphics</h5>\r\n\r\n<p>Social media graphics that can be used to inform school communities about the benefits of filling out the meal benefit application:</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Download Orange Social Media Graphic:<br />\r\n<a class=\"file file--mime-image-jpeg file--image\" data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"f3df9984-79ac-4395-bd4c-fa019e3ea559\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/filling%20out%20the%20app_orange_Social_0.jpg\">JPG</a> | <a class=\"file file--mime-image-png file--image\" data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"93ef03d0-c634-4b74-ab61-a75dd1207fda\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/filling%20out%20the%20app_orange_Social_0.png\">PNG</a> | <a class=\"file file--mime-application-pdf file--application-pdf\" data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"5dbc094d-336c-47bc-9046-c53dc981e37e\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/filling%20out%20the%20app_orange_Social_0.pdf\">PDF</a></p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"Why you Should Fill out the school meal benefit application\" data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"8963af95-d38c-4b5d-a4cc-c5e617518fe8\" height=\"115\" src=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-images/filling%20out%20the%20app_Blue_Social.jpg\" width=\"223\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Download Blue Social Media Graphic:<br />\r\n<a class=\"file file--mime-image-jpeg file--image\" data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"e7c3831e-da7b-4700-9451-0e8e104a5659\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/filling%20out%20the%20app_Blue_Social_0.jpg\">JPG</a> | <a class=\"file file--mime-image-png file--image\" data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"5696f0dd-f396-4980-b81c-78c10a20cf0c\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/filling%20out%20the%20app_Blue_Social_0.png\">PNG</a> | <a class=\"file file--mime-application-pdf file--application-pdf\" data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"cd7f7d44-b3a7-47e9-b48f-564849f39dbc\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/filling%20out%20the%20app_Blue_Social_0.pdf\">PDF</a></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"card\">\r\n<div class=\"card-body\">\r\n<h5 class=\"card-title\">Informational Materials</h5>\r\n\r\n<ul class=\"list-group list-group-flush\">\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\">One page Informational&nbsp;that can be distributed to families/caregivers:<br />\r\n\t-&nbsp;<a class=\"file file--mime-application-pdf file--application-pdf\" data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"e156e4fc-377d-4f9d-9752-27c8613cc680\" filename=\"English-Meal Benefit Application Informational One Pager.pdf\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/English-Meal%20Benefit%20Application%20Informational%20One%20Pager.pdf\">English&nbsp;</a><br />\r\n\t-&nbsp;<a class=\"file file--mime-application-pdf file--application-pdf\" data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"9d19e693-fb26-4c4b-96eb-da71c89f2b12\" filename=\"Somali-Meal Benefit Application Informational One Pager.pdf\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Somali-Meal%20Benefit%20Application%20Informational%20One%20Pager.pdf\">Somali </a>&nbsp;<br />\r\n\t-&nbsp;<a class=\"file file--mime-application-pdf file--application-pdf\" data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"89bfcfc1-24b1-475c-8f00-4ff331d538af\" filename=\"Portuguese-Meal Benefit Application Informational One Pager.pdf\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Portuguese-Meal%20Benefit%20Application%20Informational%20One%20Pager.pdf\">Portuguese (Angolan)</a> &nbsp;<br />\r\n\t-&nbsp;<a class=\"file file--mime-application-pdf file--application-pdf\" data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"920ff857-e373-414f-aacc-194472536162\" filename=\"Spanish-Meal Benefit Application Informational One Pager.pdf\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Spanish-Meal%20Benefit%20Application%20Informational%20One%20Pager.pdf\">Spanish&nbsp;</a>&nbsp;<br />\r\n\t-&nbsp;<a class=\"file file--mime-application-pdf file--application-pdf\" data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"db3dcac0-4e16-450e-be12-0cf779acf5f1\" filename=\"French-Meal Benefit Application Informational One Pager.pdf\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/French-Meal%20Benefit%20Application%20Informational%20One%20Pager.pdf\">French</a> &nbsp;<br />\r\n\t-&nbsp;<a class=\"file file--mime-application-pdf file--application-pdf\" data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"b488d068-6277-480e-b76d-6e61c65ede66\" filename=\"Chinese-Meal Benefit Application Informational One Pager.pdf\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Chinese-Meal%20Benefit%20Application%20Informational%20One%20Pager.pdf\">Chinese (Mandarin) &nbsp;</a><br />\r\n\t-&nbsp;<a class=\"file file--mime-application-pdf file--application-pdf\" data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"8c26f259-9702-4e79-8ead-b1960d1b7ada\" filename=\"Vietnamese-Meal Benefit Application Informational One Pager.pdf\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Vietnamese-Meal%20Benefit%20Application%20Informational%20One%20Pager.pdf\">Vietnamese</a> &nbsp;<br />\r\n\t-&nbsp;<a class=\"file file--mime-application-pdf file--application-pdf\" data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"97a81a64-6818-47d6-bbf8-4d510bd8efd0\" filename=\"Kinyarwanda-Meal Benefit Application Informational One Pager.pdf\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Kinyarwanda-Meal%20Benefit%20Application%20Informational%20One%20Pager.pdf\">Kinyarwanda</a> &nbsp;<br />\r\n\t-&nbsp;<a class=\"file file--mime-application-pdf file--application-pdf\" data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"2482a46f-59db-444d-81f2-1215ac7e564b\" filename=\"Khmer-Meal Benefit Application Informational One Pager.pdf\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Khmer-Meal%20Benefit%20Application%20Informational%20One%20Pager.pdf\">Central Khmer</a> &nbsp;<br />\r\n\t-&nbsp;<a class=\"file file--mime-application-pdf file--application-pdf\" data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"52f7c7a4-4d04-48e2-835e-1507eb9f6c82\" filename=\"Swahili-Meal Benefit Application Informational One Pager.pdf\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Swahili-Meal%20Benefit%20Application%20Informational%20One%20Pager.pdf\">Swahili</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\">One Page Informational Resource for Staff Members (PDF)</li>\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\">&nbsp;</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"card\">\r\n<div class=\"card-body\">\r\n<h5 class=\"card-title\">Form Options</h5>\r\n\r\n<h4><strong>Online Application</strong></h4>\r\n\r\n<p>Beginning July 1, 2026, the Free and Reduced Meals Application is available through <a href=\"https://www.mymaineconnection.gov/benefits/s/?language=en_US\">My Maine Connection</a>.</p>\r\n\r\n<h4><strong>Alternative SAMPLE Form</strong></h4>\r\n\r\n<p>If after understanding all of the benefits of the Meal Benefit Application, parents/caregivers still do not want to fill it out, the Maine DOE has&nbsp;a&nbsp;less invasive SAMPLE form* that can be used by schools to help inform the State of Maine and the Federal Government of the community's&nbsp;financial needs.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n","after":"<div class=\"doe-hero\">\n<p class=\"doe-eyebrow\">Student Eligibility & Applications</p>\n<p class=\"doe-lead\">The family income data provided by the application informs key <strong>funding </strong>for school resources. This includes school meal reimbursements, funding for Title I programs, funding and resources for after school programs, funding provided to schools from the Maine State Legislature for essential programs and services at school, funding for special education, teacher loan forgiveness, and much, <em>much </em>more!</p>\n\n</div>\n\r\n\r\n<p>The resources below can be used by districts and schools to help inform parents, caregivers, and staff members about the importance of the Meal Benefit Application in hopes of getting as many families and caregivers to fill out and return the application as possible.&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"card-deck\">\r\n<div class=\"card\">\r\n<div class=\"card-body\">\r\n<h3 class=\"card-title\">Social Media Graphics</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Social media graphics that can be used to inform school communities about the benefits of filling out the meal benefit application:</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Download Orange Social Media Graphic:<br />\r\n<a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/filling%20out%20the%20app_orange_Social_0.jpg\">JPG</a> | <a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/filling%20out%20the%20app_orange_Social_0.png\">PNG</a> | <a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/filling%20out%20the%20app_orange_Social_0.pdf\">PDF</a></p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"Why you Should Fill out the school meal benefit application\" height=\"115\" src=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-images/filling%20out%20the%20app_Blue_Social.jpg\" width=\"223\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Download Blue Social Media Graphic:<br />\r\n<a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/filling%20out%20the%20app_Blue_Social_0.jpg\">JPG</a> | <a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/filling%20out%20the%20app_Blue_Social_0.png\">PNG</a> | <a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/filling%20out%20the%20app_Blue_Social_0.pdf\">PDF</a></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"card\">\r\n<div class=\"card-body\">\r\n<h3 class=\"card-title\">Informational Materials</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul class=\"list-group list-group-flush\">\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\">One page Informational&nbsp;that can be distributed to families/caregivers:<br />\r\n\t-&nbsp;<a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/English-Meal%20Benefit%20Application%20Informational%20One%20Pager.pdf\">English</a>&nbsp;<br />\r\n\t-&nbsp;<a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Somali-Meal%20Benefit%20Application%20Informational%20One%20Pager.pdf\">Somali</a> &nbsp;<br />\r\n\t-&nbsp;<a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Portuguese-Meal%20Benefit%20Application%20Informational%20One%20Pager.pdf\">Portuguese (Angolan)</a> &nbsp;<br />\r\n\t-&nbsp;<a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Spanish-Meal%20Benefit%20Application%20Informational%20One%20Pager.pdf\">Spanish</a>&nbsp;&nbsp;<br />\r\n\t-&nbsp;<a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/French-Meal%20Benefit%20Application%20Informational%20One%20Pager.pdf\">French</a> &nbsp;<br />\r\n\t-&nbsp;<a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Chinese-Meal%20Benefit%20Application%20Informational%20One%20Pager.pdf\">Chinese (Mandarin)</a> &nbsp;<br />\r\n\t-&nbsp;<a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Vietnamese-Meal%20Benefit%20Application%20Informational%20One%20Pager.pdf\">Vietnamese</a> &nbsp;<br />\r\n\t-&nbsp;<a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Kinyarwanda-Meal%20Benefit%20Application%20Informational%20One%20Pager.pdf\">Kinyarwanda</a> &nbsp;<br />\r\n\t-&nbsp;<a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Khmer-Meal%20Benefit%20Application%20Informational%20One%20Pager.pdf\">Central Khmer</a> &nbsp;<br />\r\n\t-&nbsp;<a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Swahili-Meal%20Benefit%20Application%20Informational%20One%20Pager.pdf\">Swahili</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\">One Page Informational Resource for Staff Members (PDF)</li>\r\n\t\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"card\">\r\n<div class=\"card-body\">\r\n<h3 class=\"card-title\">Form Options</h3>\r\n\r\n<h3>Online Application</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Beginning July 1, 2026, the Free and Reduced Meals Application is available through <a href=\"https://www.mymaineconnection.gov/benefits/s/?language=en_US\">My Maine Connection</a>.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Alternative SAMPLE Form</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>If after understanding all of the benefits of the Meal Benefit Application, parents/caregivers still do not want to fill it out, the Maine DOE has&nbsp;a&nbsp;less invasive SAMPLE form* that can be used by schools to help inform the State of Maine and the Federal Government of the community's&nbsp;financial needs.</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n\r\n\n<p class=\"doe-top\"><a href=\"#top\">Back to top</a></p>","notes":[],"decisions":[{"id":"cardtitles","on":true,"label":"Put the card titles on one level","why":"3 card titles are written at a level copied from an example rather than chosen — h5 on a page whose sections are h2. Only the number changes.","value":"3 titles"},{"id":"deck","on":true,"label":"Use this paragraph as the page description","why":"It is the page’s own opening paragraph, moved into the banner rather than rewritten.","value":"The family income data provided by the application informs key funding for school resources. This includes school meal reimbursements, funding for Title I programs, funding and resources for after school programs, funding provided to schools from the Maine State Legislature for essential programs and services at school, funding for special education, teacher loan forgiveness, and much, much more!"},{"id":"capheadings","on":true,"label":"Bring every heading up to h3 or above","why":"2 headings sat at h4 or deeper inside a card, a callout, a contact block or an accordion panel — components the outline walk leaves alone because they label a thing rather than a section. A reader using a screen reader still hears the level, so a fourth-level title inside a page that only goes to three is announced as belonging to a level that does not exist. Each is styled by its class and its position rather than its number, so nothing changes on screen.","value":"2 headings"},{"id":"eyebrow","on":true,"label":"Eyebrow: \"Student Eligibility & Applications\"","why":"Taken from the parent page, /schools/nutrition/studenteligibility."}],"mechanical":["empty paragraphs removed: 3","drupal entity attrs stripped: 60","empty list items removed: 1","redundant bold inside a heading removed: 2","space moved out of a link: 4"],"findings":[],"safe":true,"audit":{"alias":"/schools/nutrition/studenteligibility/mealbenefittoolkit","title":"Meal Benefit Application Toolkit for Schools","changed":"2026-06-17T19:25:07+00:00","words":264,"bytes":7815,"fixes":["empty paragraphs removed: 3","drupal entity attrs stripped: 60","empty list items removed: 1","redundant bold inside a heading removed: 2","space moved out of a link: 4"],"flags":["no section-header device","h5 card titles"],"contentSafe":true,"headings":[{"l":5,"t":"Social Media Graphics","bh":false},{"l":5,"t":"Informational Materials","bh":false},{"l":5,"t":"Form Options","bh":false},{"l":4,"t":"Online Application","bh":false},{"l":4,"t":"Alternative SAMPLE Form","bh":false}],"outline":[{"i":0,"issue":"jumps h1 to h5","text":"Social Media Graphics"}],"components":{"cards":10,"cardHeaders":0,"cardTitles":3,"accordio